    flavorText: Daniel proposes a ten-day trial of pulse and water instead of the
      king's rich food, and the four youths emerge fairer and fatter than everyone
      else.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Tests whether faithfulness to God's dietary conviction can be maintained
      under royal pressure to defile oneself with the king's rich food and wine;
      demonstrates that trust in God's provision outperforms the king's own fare.
    deliveredByManagerId: daniel
